1648 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Work experience\nProduct Designer \nHyundai Motor Technical Center\054 UX Studio Frankfurt\055 Internship \nApril 2026 \055 September 2026\054 Germany \nDesigned and validated next\055generation EV and infotainment experiences through real\055world research\054 journey redesign and interactive HMI prototyping\054 while contributing to cross\055market research and future concepts for AI\055driven in\055car experiences\056\nEvaluated how clearly the system communicated failures\054 alternative routes\054 charging options\054 and next steps\054 identifying UX gaps across routing\054 charging\054 and in\055car guidance\056\nBuilt and tested interactive ProtoPie prototypes integrated with an in\055car simulator\054 validating proposed HMI concepts in realistic driving scenarios and translating findings into design improvements\056\nCoordinated cross\055market research on AI\055driven in\055car experiences across Hyundai UX Studios in Europe\054 Korea\054 China\054 and the US\054 translating findings into UX recommendations and future concepts\056\n\nProduct Designer\nAllianz Technologies \055 Working student\nMarch 2024 \055 March 2026\054 Germany\nDesigned scalable UI components\054 interaction patterns and accessible experiences for Allianz\031s global design system\054 supporting 10\053 applications and 50\053 teams while exploring AI\055enabled design\055to\055code workflows and new product concepts\056\n Defined accessibility guidelines aligned with WCAG and EAA standards\054 enabling 50\053 teams to build compliant and inclusive experiences\056\nIntegrated Figma MCP into design\055to\055code workflows\054 making design\055system components easier for AI coding tools to interpret and implement\056\n\nProduct Designer\nDeutsche Telekom \055 Internship\nMay 2023 \055 Nov 2023\054 Germany \nCo\055designed and validated an internal digital product through usability studies across 20\053 workflows\054 translating research findings into clearer journeys\054 stronger concepts and better\055informed product decisions\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1649 0 R
